  "#exclusion_note": [
    "exclusionradius = max(exclusion_min, exclusion_ratio x drawn size).",
    "",
    "The FLOOR is stock's own convention, not a concession: data/shipData.yaml gives",
    "tsn_fighter, tsn_bomber and tsn_shuttle a flat 25 regardless of how small the hull",
    "is. So a bubble larger than the craft is correct for cockpit-class ships, and the",
    "TNG Danube and Peregrine were never wrong. What IS wrong is the other direction -",
    "the Scimitar, the Mogai and the Command Starbase carry a bubble around a third of",
    "their length, so ships fly into the model."
  ]
